# Route: guide 22 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Gnome (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 42 to 44, 65
# quests, 2.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Ironforge, Stormwind City, Badlands, Alterac Mountains, Arathi
# Highlands, Hillsbrad Foothills): Ironforge -> near Ironforge -> Ironforge ->
# near Ironforge -> Ironforge -> near Ironforge -> near Stormwind City -> near
# Stormwind -> Stormwind City -> near Ironforge -> Agmond's End -> Valley of
# Fangs -> Angor Fortress -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Save Techbot's Brain! (2922;
# Techbot 26); The Black Box (708; Zaricotl 55-56); The Perenolde Tiara (543;
# Grel'borg the Miser 39); The Star, the Hand and the Heart (735; Grel'borg
# the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44); The Shattered
# Necklace (2198; Shadowforge Surveyor 35-36, Shadowforge Ruffian 36-37,
# Shadowforge Digger 35-36, Stonevault Rockchewer 36-37, Stonevault Oracle
# 37-38, Stonevault Cave Hunter 36-37); Amulet of Secrets (722; Magregan
# Deepshadow 38); Crushridge Warmongers (504; Crushridge Warmonger 39-40).
#
# Left out: Data Hoarders (95041): the route takes them here but cannot finish
# them (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps
# (971), Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The
# Lost Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace
# (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924), Essential
# Artificials (2924), The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal (2929),
# Data Rescue (2930), Data Rescue (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341), The Fate
# of the Kingdom (4362), The Restless Dead (96394), The Restless Dead (96394),
# An Ancient Grudge (96395), Important Heirlooms (96403), Important Heirlooms
# (96403), The Treaty of Understanding (98423), Quell The Uprising (387),
# Quell the Uprising (387), The Color of Blood (388), The Color of Blood
# (388), The Stockade Riots (391), The Stockade Riots (391), Underground
# Assault (2040), Underground Assault (2040), Bring the Light (3636), A Green
# Sample (92456), A Green Sample (92456), Power Overwhelming (92489), Power
# Overwhelming (92489), Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), Kibler's Exotic Pets
